(3) Additional career enhancement may be gained by continuing to pursue technical certification for civilian certifications through the Army IgnitED website.', '81d3099d2f1b8b82f6cf0e33c4c59bd346a2064671cefbcf35120d14c4792c26', 3, 4, '3', 35, null, null, false, null),
